Options under consideration (see the project plan):
  - MIT OR Apache-2.0 (dual), like EffectCraft and PhotoCraft — allows
    contributing code upstream to the Craft apps; Apache-2.0 requires keeping
    the NOTICE file.
  - GPL-3.0 — keeps derivatives open, but cannot be accepted upstream under
    the Craft apps' clean-room rules.

Replace this file with the full licence text (or LICENSE-MIT + LICENSE-APACHE)
before the repository is made public.
